        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-07T14:42:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It does not get +1 for the cold damage as it is melee now. Changing Abz's damage to anything but Fire or Cold really shuts him down unless he has Thermal Shockwave out. As anything he does he'll deal himself damage for no reason.</p>",
