        "created_at": "2013-04-07T14:52:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks, Ronway.</p><p>Playing games with my family is fun (I'm in my mid-40s and my folks are in their early 70s.), but when there's a rule that's a bit unclear, my dad really wants to make sure we're playing it correctly while I like to make a quick decision, move on with the game, and see if I can find the answer later.</p><p>Thanks for the Thermal Shockwave tip too!</p>",
