        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-07T20:19:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another thing to watch out for with Ab'Zero is if Ra is in the party - Imbued Fire would be somewhat unhelpful for Ab'Zero since all his damage is converted to fire and therefore he can't hit himself with cold damage in order to heal himself. On the other hand, as long as ra <span class=\"bbcode-i\">doesn't</span> play Imbued Fire he can nuke Ab'Zero repeatedly and cause loads of other effects to go off that way :).</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:34:51.902Z",
